owing cognitive summary first, screenshot loads in background\n- Frontend: Fixed OCR to always use REST (removed MCP dependency for OCR)\n- Frontend: Added proactive information display in chat when tooltips load\n\nPerformance improvements:\n- Reduced network latency: 1 request instead of 2 for tooltips\n- Faster perceived performance: cognitive summary shows immediately\n- Better UX: screenshots load progressively in background\n\nTechnical improvements:\n- Screenshot storage: File-based with automatic cleanup\n- Error handling: Graceful fallbacks if disk storage fails\n- Backward compatible: Old endpoints still work\n- Better error messages: Warnings instead of errors for expected failures","tree":{"sha":"5dd858a67f4f854e33292e6ee6ec78a1fcec5274","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcpmessenger/mcp-messenger-landing-page/git/trees/5dd858a67f4f854e33292e6ee6ec78a1fcec5274"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcpmessenger/mcp-messenger-landing-page/git/commits/ded75999148dac1504c1461e2a780b45f22dd155","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mcpmessenger/mcp-messenger-landing-page/commit/ded75999148dac1504c1461e2a780b45f22dd155","node_id":"C_kwDOQyTuxtoAKGRlZDc1OTk5MTQ4ZGFjMTUwNGMxNDYxZTJhNzgwYjQ1ZjIyZGQxNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mcpmessenger/mcp-messenger-landing-page/commit/485c7a86f407a9664876298918fa485ae2b4a249","sha":"485c7a86f407a9664876298918fa485ae2b4a249","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcpmessenger/mcp-messenger-landing-page/commits/485c7a86f407a9664876298918fa485ae2b4a249"}],"sha":"ded75999148dac1504c1461e2a780b45f22dd155","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcpmessenger/mcp-messenger-landing-page/commits/ded75999148dac1504c1461e2a780b45f22dd155"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcpmessenger/mcp-messenger-landing-page/commits/485c7a86f407a9664876298918fa485ae2b4a249/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-03T05:08:50Z","email":"developer@chromium.local","name":"Chromium Developer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-03T05:08:50Z","email":"developer@chromium.local","name":"Chromium Developer"},"message":"feat: Implement consolidated /context endpoint and hybrid tooltips\n\nMajor improvements:\n- Backend: Added /context endpoint that returns screenshot + analysis in one call\n- Backend: Implemented signed URLs for screenshots (file-based storage)\n- Backend: Added /screenshot/:token endpoint for serving screenshots\n- Frontend: Updated to use /context endpoint instead of separate /capture and /analyze\n- Frontend: Implemented hybrid tooltip showing cognitive summary first, screenshot loads in background\n- Frontend: Fixed OCR to always use REST (removed MCP dependency for OCR)\n- Frontend: Added proactive information display in chat when tooltips load\n\nPerformance improvements:\n- Reduced network latency: 1 request instead of 2 for tooltips\n- Faster perceived performance: cognitive summary shows immediately\n- Better UX: screenshots load progressively in background\n\nTechnical improvements:\n- Screenshot storage: File-based with automatic cleanup\n- Error handling: Graceful fallbacks if disk storage fails\n- Backward compatible: Old endpoints still work\n- Better error messages: Warnings instead of errors for expected failures","tree":{"sha":"96c0d7343d1c5c4e797faea0d1804e1cc5658a72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcpmessenger/mcp-messenger-landing-page/git/trees/96c0d7343d1c5c4e797faea0d1804e1cc5658a72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcpmessenger/mcp-messenger-landing-page/git/commits/485c7a86f407a9664876298918fa485ae2b4a249","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mcpmessenger/mcp-messenger-landing-page/commit/485c7a86f407a9664876298918fa485ae2b4a249","node_id":"C_kwDOQyTuxtoAKDQ4NWM3YTg2ZjQwN2E5NjY0ODc2M