bd2f22955c18b0a48272df3ac142c7a1077"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/commits/a77e8872ec0155054eeddf21a5de8785c8513a23","verification":{"payload":"tree 75e4abd2f22955c18b0a48272df3ac142c7a1077\nparent e3c207f13ce88ba2161aec170d041931ba095d5d\nauthor Sushruth Sastry <shastry.sushruth@gmail.com> 1780958044 -0700\ncommitter Sushruth Sastry <shastry.sushruth@gmail.com> 1780958044 -0700\n\nprune: strip dead code, no-op packages, and unused scaffolding\n\nRemove @fe/jit-plugin-react (no-op package, zero transform logic).\nRemove package-json-config-provider.ts (unused adapter, zero imports).\nStrip updatePolicy from Plugin interface and plugin-loader (version-check\nmachinery never exercised; no external plugins exist).\nStrip 17 unused hooks.callHook() invocations across 6 CLI plugins\n(all fired into empty listener sets; only build:options waterfall retained).\nRemove kleur dependency from @fe/cli (imported nowhere).\nRemove duplicate @fe/core from @fe/cli devDependencies.\n\nFix CI: sandbox build step was running `bun run check` on packages\nwithout check scripts; now runs `fe check` from sandbox workspace.\nRemove jit-plugin-react from packages typecheck job.\n\nDocument all pruned features as future hypotheses in\ndocs/architecture/FUTURE-FEATURES.md so they remain visible\nfor deliberate rebuild when real need arises.\n\nUpdate all agent config files and docs site HTML fragments\nto reflect the removals.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgihZXykC7fng3CqlgGfNFC1mDFV\nZZHK/+4dgh+F8J5O4AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNU+ItojdgXUtoJWE5vbkpLbAJyy6ZJD1PAK69zSge8/NupKx7JN9c9NXI7PlBNhEd\n9Y4LC2qXCW3limtlNAvQE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-04T09:05:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2114206?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/events{/privacy}","fol