i helpers.ts to import from @fe/specifier; remove local\n  definitions; filter devDeps via isMfeSpecifier\n- Update @fe/runtime platform.ts to import parseSpecVersion from @fe/specifier;\n  remove local definition\n- Update @fe/compiler default external patterns from [\"fe(*)\"] to\n  [\"@*/fe.*\", \"fe.*\"] to match new format\n- Add @fe/specifier workspace dependency to @fe/cli and @fe/runtime\n- Rename all MFE and toolkit packages:\n    fe(acme/mfe-a)    → @acme/fe.mfe-a\n    fe(acme/mfe-b)    → @acme/fe.mfe-b\n    fe(acme/devtools) → @acme/fe.devtools\n    fe(acme/store)    → @acme/fe.store\n    fe(acme/network)  → @acme/fe.network\n- Update devDependency keys in mfe-b, host-app to use new specifier format\n- Update sandbox/configs/platform.json routes, devtools, and packages keys\n- Update sandbox/mfe-b/src/index.tsx import from @acme/fe.mfe-a\n- Update sandbox/host-app/tests/host.spec.ts specifier string literals\n- Add @fe/specifier to packages job in .github/workflows/ci.yml\n- Update all AGENTS.md files and root README.md to reflect new convention\n- Add production-readiness disclaimer to README.md\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011XRTb9aSwQi2PNzQeRvQqX\n\n* chore(toolkit): cut slop, add tests, bump versions\n\nsyntax-highlighter (0.0.8 → 0.0.9):\n- Remove @module docblocks and redundant JSDoc from core.ts,\n  types.ts, and all four language files\n- Tighten JSDoc on highlight(), applyTheme(), setHighlightSheet(),\n  registerLanguage(), and the categories export\n- Simplify Rule interface comment; collapse LanguageRules comment\n- Add src/core.test.ts: ts keyword pattern and json boolean pattern\n- Rewrite README: drop \"2-3x faster\" claim and feature-list marketing;\n  add browser support table; keep credits and usage accurate\n\nweb-components (0.1.1 → 0.1.2):\n- Add JSDoc to all four exported classes (HTMLInclude, FEComponent,\n  FECompose, FECode)\n- Add src/scoping.test.ts: four tests for the selector-scoping\n  algorithm used by FEComponent (pure logic, no DOM required)\n- Trim CSS scoping section in README; no other changes needed\n- Update syntax-highlighter pin in jsr.json to ^0.0.9\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011XRTb9aSwQi2PNzQeRvQqX\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"236d841cda3d9b6721ef3bdd232943f4d9b7d00f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/trees/236d841cda3d9b6721ef3bdd232943f4d9b7d00f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/commits/ed8d3bd935271f3259f9382e7f14a96b5e02b3f4","verification":{"payload":"tree 236d841cda3d9b6721ef3bdd232943f4d9b7d00f\nparent 81c5bd54add2017e3fc30633af7caab4385a717c\nauthor Sushruth Sastry <2114206+sushruth@users.noreply.github.com> 1772923857 -0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772923857 -0800\n\nMigrate MFE specifier convention from fe() to @scope/fe.name (#34)\n\n* feat: migrate MFE specifiers from fe(scope/name) to @scope/fe.name\n\n- Add packages/specifier/ (@fe/specifier v0.1.0) with isMfeSpecifier,\n  parseSpecVersion, and slugFromSpecifier utilities\n- Update @fe/cli helpers.ts to import from @fe/specifier; remove local\n  definitions; filter devDeps via isMfeSpecifier\n- Update @fe/runtime platform.ts to import parseSpecVersion from @fe/specifier;\n  remove local definition\n- Update @fe/compiler default external patterns from [\"fe(*)\"] to\n  [\"@*/fe.*\", \"fe.*\"] to match new format\n- Add @fe/specifier workspace dependency to @fe/cli and @fe/runtime\n- Rename all MFE and toolkit packages:\n    fe(acme/mfe-a)    → @acme/fe.mfe-a\n    fe(acme/mfe-b)    → @acme/fe.mfe-b\n    fe(acme/devtools) → @acme/fe.devtools\n    fe(acme/store)    → @acme/fe.store\n    fe(acme/network)  → @acme/fe.network\n- Update devDependency keys in mfe-b, host-app to use new specifier format\n- Update sandbox/configs/platform.json routes, devtools, and packages keys\n- Update sandbox/mfe-b/src/index.tsx import from @acme/fe.mfe-a\n- Update sandbox/host-app/tests/host.spec.ts s