Specifier into a\ndedicated published package so CLI, runtime, compiler, and third-party\nplugins can all depend on a single source of truth.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_014xQ5ZocwttZCYG2m4WLs4H\n\n* docs(agents): add git diff hygiene guide for token efficiency\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"98e714826f4e5786c8537be303a58c3f9196c885","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/trees/98e714826f4e5786c8537be303a58c3f9196c885"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/commits/81c5bd54add2017e3fc30633af7caab4385a717c","verification":{"payload":"tree 98e714826f4e5786c8537be303a58c3f9196c885\nparent 38288143c0db444e15842e120ffd5a2e4b818ef5\nauthor Sushruth Sastry <2114206+sushruth@users.noreply.github.com> 1772917529 -0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772917529 -0800\n\ndocs: MFE specifier migration plan (fe() → @scope/fe.name) (#33)\n\n* docs: add specifier migration plan (fe() → @scope/fe.name)\n\nPlans the transition from fe(scope/name) to @scope/fe.name format,\ngaining jsr.io compatibility and native registry scope-based auth.\nIncludes exhaustive file list, code diffs for helpers.ts, JSR publish\ncommands, and disclaimer text for docs.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_014xQ5ZocwttZCYG2m4WLs4H\n\n* docs: fix specifier detection to support unscoped fe. names\n\nRegex updated from /^@[^/]+\\/fe\\./ to /^(?:@[^/]+\\/)?fe\\./\nso that both @acme/fe.name and fe.name are recognized as MFE\nspecifiers. parseSpecVersion guard added for at <= 0 edge case.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_014xQ5ZocwttZCYG2m4WLs4H\n\n* docs: add @fe/specifier package to migration plan\n\nExtracts isMfeSpecifier, parseSpecVersion, slugFromSpecifier into a\ndedicated published package so CLI, runtime, compiler, and third-party\nplugins can all depend on a single source of truth.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_014xQ5ZocwttZCYG2m4WLs4H\n\n* docs(agents): add git diff hygiene guide for token e