s and JSR version constraint for publish\n\n- Add compilerOptions.lib to jsr.json (Deno ignores tsconfig.json lib during publish)\n- Add version constraint to jsr:@fe-platform/syntax-highlighter specifier\n- Add explicit type annotation to HTMLInclude._eagerPending (JSR slow-types check)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6e3e39953d12537a5c3d15247eb9388d4d04a46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/trees/c6e3e39953d12537a5c3d15247eb9388d4d04a46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/commits/143d44801efea745232cde01212d020fa45e18d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/143d44801efea745232cde01212d020fa45e18d3","node_id":"C_kwDOQyVLeNoAKDE0M2Q0NDgwMWVmZWE3NDUyMzJjZGUwMTIxMmQwMjBmYTQ1ZTE4ZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/46a779c4fb381d30976345b29784579492117fa4","sha":"46a779c4fb381d30976345b29784579492117fa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/46a779c4fb381d30976345b29784579492117fa4"}],"sha":"143d44801efea745232cde01212d020fa45e18d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/143d44801efea745232cde01212d020fa45e18d3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/46a779c4fb381d30976345b29784579492117fa4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T05:16:03Z","email":"sushruth.sastry@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T05:16:03Z","email":"sushruth.sastry@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"message":"feat(toolkit): add @fe-platform/web-components package\n\nExtracts the four custom elements from docs/site/index.html into a\nreusable JSR package with individual file exports.\n\n- html-include: fragment loader with eager/lazy strategies, fires\n  ''load'' and ''fragments-ready'' events\n- fe-component: template registry with light-DOM CSS scoping\n- fe-compose: slot-based composition, forwards attributes to root\n- fe-code: syntax-highlighted code blocks via dynamic import\n\nAdds package.json to syntax-highlighter so workspace:* resolution\nworks for IDEs and tsc.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0f472cb6f5d85215d8861c8e9f50d83b4f5420a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/trees/d0f472cb6f5d85215d8861c8e9f50d83b4f5420a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/commits/46a779c4fb381d30976345b29784579492117fa4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/46a779c4fb381d30976345b29784579492117fa4","node_id":"C_kwDOQyVLeNoAKDQ2YTc3OWM0ZmIzODFkMzA5NzYzNDViMjk3ODQ1Nzk0OTIxMTdmYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/61372580ad2c7b9b24374bffcffb56035dfc28b4","sha":"61372580ad2c7b9b24374bffcffb56035dfc28b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/61372580ad2c7b9b24374bffcffb56035dfc28b4"}],"sha":"46a779c4fb381d30976345b29784579492117fa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/46a779c4fb381d30976345b29784579492117fa4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/61372580ad2c7b9b24374bffcffb56035dfc28b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T04:16:23Z","email":"sushruth.sastry@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T04:16:23Z","email":"sushruth.sastry@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"message":"docs: fix lang attribute on HTML code block in platform-eng fragment\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"22f1c9d47f7fbd3839880dddd6bf62ff6dc690e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/trees/22f1c9d47f7fbd3839880dddd6bf62ff6dc690e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/commits/61372580ad2c7b9b24374bffcffb56035dfc28b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/61372580ad2c7b9b24374bffcffb56035dfc28b4","node_id":"C_kwDOQyVLeNoAKDYxMzcyNTgwYWQyYzdiOWIyNDM3NGJmZmNmZmI1NjAzNWRmYzI4YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/26e82509ff83bbe1bd47d57c3af78bdeb36969d2","sha":"26e82509ff83bbe1bd47d57c3af78bdeb36969d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/26e82509ff83bbe1bd47d57c3af78bdeb36969d2"}],"sha":"61372580ad2c7b9b24374bffcffb56035dfc28b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/61372580ad2c7b9b24374bffcffb56035dfc28b4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/26e82509ff83bbe1bd47d57c3af78bdeb36969d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T04:11:32Z","email":"sushruth.sastry@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T04:13:09Z","email":"sushruth.sastry@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"message":"docs: refactor site to component assembly pattern with html-include, fe-component, fe-compose\n\n- Replace numbered fragments with named fragments (header, hero, architecture, etc.)\n- Inline all JS/CSS into index.html; remove external main.js and style.css\n- Add html-include web component with eager/lazy loading and fetch dedup guard\n- Add fe-component web component for CSS scoping via selector rewriting\n- Add fe-compose web component for slot-based Light DOM composition\n- Add fe-code web component for inline syntax highlighting\n- Use name= attribute on fe-component/fe-compose to avoid duplicate-id issues\n- Fix _eagerPending guard so body.ready fires correctly after fe-compose reconnects\n- Fix fe-component to snapshot children then clear, preventing accordion interference\n- Add docs/README.md documenting the assembly pattern for reuse\n- Update docs/AGENTS.md with accurate component system reference\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9fac07a6e6229ad44e6e0ebbf461bc9113561db2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/trees/9fac07a6e6229ad44e6e0ebbf461bc9113561db2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/commits/26e82509ff83bbe1bd47d57c3af78bdeb36969d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/26e82509ff83bbe1bd47d57c3af78bdeb36969d2","node_id":"C_kwDOQyVLeNoAKDI2ZTgyNTA5ZmY4M2JiZTFiZDQ3ZDU3YzNhZjc4YmRlYjM2OTY5ZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/297e24928e77ebf0075c22cf4a0ca1b300f84910","sha":"297e24928e77ebf0075c22cf4a0ca1b300f84910","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/297e24928e77ebf0075c22cf4a0ca1b300f84910"}],"sha":"26e82509ff83bbe1bd47d57c3af78bdeb36969d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/26e82509ff83bbe1bd47d57c3af78bdeb36969d2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/297e24928e77ebf0075c22cf4a0ca1b300f84910/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T20:56:30Z","email":"sushruth.sastry@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T20:56:30Z","email":"sushruth.sastry@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"message":"feat(syntax-highlighter): add html language with sub-language support for style/script","tree":{"sha":"5ae65b0591f5b88943a28763dfb34b128d3f6744","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/trees/5ae65b0591f5b88943a28