ndex.html — no JS, no build framework.\nFragments composed by build.ts cover architecture, product engineers,\nplatform engineers (POC / cloud / enterprise sub-nav), and tutorials.\nNavigation driven by details[name=\"page\"] + CSS :has(). Dark mode via\nprefers-color-scheme. Logo inlined in header. Deployed to fe.frustrated.dev.\n\nREADME condensed to match the hero section of the docs site.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b4fec0b33b28584fa2cfcf7ac5c4fc1a78ae64aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/trees/b4fec0b33b28584fa2cfcf7ac5c4fc1a78ae64aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/commits/4316e5fa6304f1ab37d223de62e45628d24ecdcf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2114206?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sushruth","id":2114206,"login":"sushruth","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTQyMDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/4316e5fa6304f1ab37d223de62e45628d24ecdcf","node_id":"C_kwDOQyVLeNoAKDQzMTZlNWZhNjMwNGYxYWIzN2QyMjNkZTYyZTQ1NjI4ZDI0ZWNkY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/1f07dbeb4b4ce34b002e3d03aaf3d7f9ba7fb6e8","sha":"1f07dbeb4b4ce34b002e3d03aaf3d7f9ba7fb6e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/1f07dbeb4b4ce34b002e3d03aaf3d7f9ba7fb6e8"}],"sha":"4316e5fa6304f1ab37d223de62e45628d24ecdcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/4316e5fa6304f1ab37d223de62e45628d24ecdcf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2114206?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sushruth","id":2114206,"login":"sushruth","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTQyMDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/1f07dbeb4b4ce34b002e3d03aaf3d7f9ba7fb6e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T08:59:38Z","email":"shastry.sushruth@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-03T08:59:38Z","email":"shastry.sushruth@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"message":"docs: add wiki covering scenarios, platform composition, internals, how-to (#16)\n\nCreates docs/ with seven pages matching the outline from issue #16:\n\n- index.md       contents + quick-reference command table\n- scenario.md    who MFEs apply to, landscape comparison, where fe fits\n- what-is-fe.md  problem statement, adoption investment, what you get\n- platform-composition.md  configs, shell, MFE teams, toolkit packages\n- fe-ownership.md  runtime, CLI, JIT bundler, CI/CD, plugin systems\n- future.md      registry, richer contracts, glue packages, testing\n- how-to.md      platform setup, creating MFEs, maintenance workflow\n- internals.md   JIT loop, import map lifecycle, plugin architecture, goals\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dfa54bbb22560e1650e7a3393e744e3388e185d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/trees/dfa54bbb22560e1650e7a3393e744e3388e185d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/commits/1f07dbeb4b4ce34b002e3d03aaf3d7f9ba7fb6e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2114206?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sushruth","id":2114206,"login":"sushruth","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTQyMDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/1f07dbeb4b4ce34b002e3d03aaf3d7f9ba7fb6e8","node_id":"C_kwDOQyVLeNoAKDFmMDdkYmViNGI0Y2UzNGIwMDJlM2QwM2FhZjNkN2Y5YmE3ZmI2ZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/8f26ed2d7c987af5b7e86587c1764b791cd001ad","sha":"8f26ed2d7c987af5b7e86587c1764b791cd001ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/8f26ed2d7c987af5b7e86587c1764b791cd001ad"}],"sha":"1f07dbeb4b4ce34b002e3d03aaf3d7f9ba7fb6e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/1f07dbeb4b4ce34b002e3d03aaf3d7f9ba7fb6e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2114206?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sushruth","id":2114206,"login":"sushruth","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTQyMDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/8f26ed2d7c987af5b7e86587c1764b791cd001ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T08:56:14Z","email":"shastry.sushruth@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-03T08:56:14Z","email":"shastry.sushruth@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"message":"feat: MFE preload story — imperative API + declarative platform.json hint (#18)\n\nAdds two ways to preload MFEs before they are navigated to:\n\nImperative: preload(specifierVersion) in @fe/runtime resolves the dep\ngraph, injects the import map, and appends a <link rel=\"modulepreload\">\nso the browser fetches the module entry without executing it. Calling\nload() afterwards uses the already-warm module cache.\n\nDeclarative: platform.json \"preload\" array (new field on PlatformConfig)\nlists specifier@version strings. @fe/runtime calls preload() for each\nentry automatically on module initialisation, after scanning existing\nimport maps so deduplication is correct.\n\nBoth paths reuse the same resolveDeps + applyOverridesAndInject logic\nas load(), so dev overrides are respected even at preload time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"40755d1f93e618007aac4796c8ad15d6801fada5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/trees/40755d1f93e618007aac4796c8ad15d6801fada5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/commits/8f26ed2d7c987af5b7e86587c1764b791cd001ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2114206?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sushruth","id":2114206,"login":"sushruth","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTQyMDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/8f26ed2d7c987af5b7e86587c1764b791cd001ad","node_id":"C_kwDOQyVLeNoAKDhmMjZlZDJkN2M5ODdhZjViN2U4NjU4N2MxNzY0Yjc5MWNkMDAxYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/83d9397b4c2e9cb92aa3c928e2a63eacc39759ad","sha":"83d9397b4c2e9cb92aa3c928e2a63eacc39759ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/83d9397b4c2e9cb92aa3c928e2a63eacc39759ad"}],"sha":"8f26ed2d7c987af5b7e86587c1764b791cd001ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/8f26ed2d7c987af5b7e86587c1764b791cd001ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2114206?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sushruth","id":2114206,"login":"sushruth","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTQyMDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/83d9397b4c2e9cb92aa3c928e2a63eacc39759ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T08:51:48Z","email":"shastry.sushruth@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-03T08:51:48Z","email":"shastry.sushruth@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"message":"feat: global network primitive — toolkit/network (fe(acme/network)) (#21)\n\nAdds a shared, framework-agnostic fetch wrapper with:\n- GET/HEAD request deduplication (concurrent callers share one Promise)\n- 30 s response cache keyed on method + URL\n- Request and response interceptor chains (add/remove at runtime)\n- invalidateCache(urlPrefix) for manual cache busting\n\nAll MFEs that import fe(acme/network) share one module instance via the\nimport map, so deduplication and interceptors work across MFE boundaries\nwithout any explicit coordination.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"186461e29c7211cb6b3a909f8aed2070b075c40c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/trees/186461e29c7211cb6b3a909f8aed2070b075c40c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/commits/83d9397b4c2e9cb92aa3c928e2a63eacc39759ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2114206?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sushruth","id":2114206,"login":"sushruth","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTQyMDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/83d9397b4c2e9cb92aa3c928e2a63eacc39759ad","node_id":"C_kwDOQyVLeNoAKDgzZDkzOTdiNGMyZTljYjkyYWEzYzkyOGUyYTYzZWFjYzM5NzU5YWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/06c9e08f71b81e28327264aff9f211644edd5d37","sha":"06c9e08f71b81e28327264aff9f211644edd5d37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/06c9e08f71b81e28327264aff9f211644edd5d37"}],"sha":"83d9397b4c2e9cb92aa3c928e2a63eacc39759ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/83d9397b4c2e9cb92aa3c928e2a63eacc39759ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2114206?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sushruth","id":2114206,"login":"sushruth","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTQyMDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/06c9e08f71b81e28327264aff9f211644edd5d37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T08:50:25Z","email":"shastry.sushruth@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-03T08:50:25Z","email":"shastry.sushruth@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"message":"feat: global state primitive — toolkit/store (fe(acme/store)) (#20)\n\nAdds a framework-agnostic cross-MFE state primitive. MFEs import it as\nan fe() dependency; the import map guarantees all MFEs share one module\ninstance and therefore one store registry.\n\nAPI: createStore(key, init) → Store { get, set, subscribe }\n     getStore(key) → Store | null\n\nThe store''s set() skips listeners when the value is reference-equal to\nthe previous one. Glue packages (react-glue, solid-glue, etc.) can wrap\nthese stores into framework-native hooks without any code living here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"37be25494460f9c096a04798713f200d263bb118","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/trees/37be25494460f9c096a04798713f200d263bb118"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/commits/06c9e08f71b81e28327264aff9f211644edd5d37","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2114206?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sushruth","id":2114206,"login":"sushruth","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTQyMDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/06c9e08f71b81e28327264aff9f211644edd5d37","node_id":"C_kwDOQyVLeNoAKDA2YzllMDhmNzFiODFlMjgzMjcyNjRhZmY5ZjIxMTY0NGVkZDVkMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/usually-frustrated/fe/commit/