:"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/857c9623fb8085b5b3acd32f69f6372577065deb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T08:03:17Z","email":"shastry.sushruth@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-03T08:03:17Z","email":"shastry.sushruth@gmail.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"message":"docs: sync all AGENTS.md and docs to current platform state\n\n- topology: add @fe/compiler, @fe/jit-plugin-react, @fe/jit-plugin-solid\n- root AGENTS.md: add jitPlugins + sourcesDir to FeConfig schema; fix deploy\n  flow (fe publish primary; devtools stays on fe admin upload); fix CI listing\n- README: add jit-plugin-react and jit-plugin-solid to packages table\n- CONTRIBUTING: fix full-stack flow (fe publish for MFEs; build+upload for devtools)\n- sandbox/host-app/AGENTS.md: fix name (shell → host-app); fix playwright config\n  snapshot to match actual playwright.config.ts\n- sandbox/configs/AGENTS.md: correct fe.config.json example; document jitPlugins\n- toolkit/devtools/AGENTS.md: rewrite build section — now uses fe build via CLI\n  with @fe/jit-plugin-solid; remove outdated build.ts + @dschz/bun-plugin-solid\n- packages/cli/AGENTS.md: expand defaults table; note publish index.ts limitation\n- new: AGENTS.md for packages/compiler, packages/runtime, packages/jit-plugin-react,\n  packages/jit-plugin-solid\n\nfix: remove stale @fe/runtime ./server export (src/jit.ts does not exist)\nfix: remove stale tsconfig.server.json and exclude from runtime tsconfig\nfix: add packages/compiler + jit-plugin-* to CI typecheck job\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9d5a0419224d69c0fa9e4d146ab3aa97c1bbfac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/trees/c9d5a0419224d69c0fa9e4d146ab3aa97c1bbfac"},"url":"https://a