api.github.com/users/sushruth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sushruth","id":2114206,"login":"sushruth","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTQyMDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushruth","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/commits/905d37efde90f1d4458f070a25168a5566c3be70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-02T08:07:13Z","email":"2114206+sushruth@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sushruth Sastry"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-02T08:07:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: JIT compiler plugin API (#22, #23, #24) (#29)\n\n* feat: JIT compiler plugin API (closes #22, #23, #24)\n\nIntroduces a `JitPlugin` interface that lets workspaces extend the Bun\nbuild pipeline without touching the CLI itself. Three related issues land\nin one cohesive change:\n\n**#22 — core plugin API**\n- `@fe/core`: new `JitPlugin` interface with `transform(options): options`\n- `BuildOptions.plugins?: unknown[]` — when set, compiler uses it directly\n  and skips Solid.js auto-detection; when absent, auto-detection runs as before\n- `BuildOptions.outdir` is now optional (compiler default: undefined / stdout)\n- `CliContext.jitPlugins: JitPlugin[]` — live array populated at bootstrap\n- `@fe/compiler`: `CompileOptions.plugins`, `createJITBundler` accepts\n  `jitPlugins` and applies transforms before each on-demand compilation\n- `@fe/cli` bun-builder passes `options.plugins` through to `compileMfe`\n- `@fe/cli` serve plugin passes `ctx.jitPlugins` to `createJITBundler`\n\n**#23 — shell-level declaration**\n- `FeConfig.jitPlugins?: string[]` — list npm packages to load as JIT plugins\n- Bootstrap loads them after CLI plugins, pushes to `ctx.jitPlugins`, then\n  registers a `build:options` waterfall hook that applies all transforms\n\n**#24 — React and Solid JIT plugins**\n- New `@fe/jit-plugin-solid`: wraps `bun-plugin-solid`, appends SolidPlugin\n  to `BuildOptions.plugins` (also disables auto-detection for that build)\n- New `@fe/jit-plugin-react`: marker plugin that sets `plugins: []`, telling\n  the compiler no framework plugin is needed (Bun handles React JSX natively)\n- `toolkit/devtools` migrated off its bespoke `build.ts`; now uses\n  `fe build toolkit/devtools` — Solid auto-detection covers it since\n  `solid-js` remains in its dependencies\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01LoG9hwHpgp29cvXsJ1neum\n\n* docs: add source-first deployment model section to root AGENTS.md\n\nGives agents and developers a named mental model for the JIT-on-server\npattern so it does not need re-explaining at the start of each session.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01LoG9hwHpgp29cvXsJ1neum\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"09c220900e7d98a5e3abe2521c1b1f93f682ee79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/trees/09c220900e7d98a5e3abe2521c1b1f93f682ee79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/usually-frustrated/fe/git/commits/905d37efde90f1d4458f070a25168a5566c3be70","verification":{"payload":"tree 09c220900e7d98a5e3abe2521c1b1f93f682ee79\nparent c6f23b8b80c73ac485c6a019aef7b1878ac9a13f\nauthor Sushruth Sastry <2114206+sushruth@users.noreply.github.com> 1772438833 -0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772438833 -0800\n\nfeat: JIT compiler plugin API (#22, #23, #24) (#29)\n\n* feat: JIT compiler plugin API (closes #22, #23, #24)\n\nIntroduces a `JitPlugin` interface that lets workspaces extend the Bun\nbuild pipeline without touching the CLI itself. Three related issues land\nin one cohesive change:\n\n**#22 — core plugin API**\n- `@fe/core`: new `JitPlugin` interface with `transform(options): options`\n- `BuildOptions.plugins?: unknown[]` — when set, compiler uses it directly\n  and skips Solid.js auto-detection; when absent, auto-detection runs as before\n- `BuildOptions.outdir` is now optional (compiler default: undefined / stdout)\n- `CliContext.jitPlugins: JitPlugin[]` — live array populated at bootstrap\n- `@fe/compiler`: `CompileOptions.plugins`, `createJITBundler` accepts\n  `jitPlugins` and applies transforms before each on-demand compilation\n- `@fe/cli` bun-builder passes `options.plugins` through to `compileMfe`\n- `@fe/cli` serve plugin passes `ctx.jitPlugins` to `createJITBundler`\n\n**#23 — shell-level declaration**\n- `FeConfig.jitPlugins?: string[]` — list npm packages to load as JIT plugins\n- Bootstrap loads them after CLI plugins, pushes to `ctx.jitPlugins`, then\n  registers a `build:options` waterfall hook that applies all transforms\n\n**#24 — React and Solid JIT plugins**\n- New `@fe/jit-plugin-solid`: wraps `bun-plugin-solid`, appends SolidPlugin\n  to `BuildOptions.plugins` (also disables auto-detection for that build)\n- New `@fe/jit-plugin-react`: marker plugin that sets `plugins: []`, telling\n  the compiler no framework plugin is needed (Bun handles React JSX natively)\n- `toolkit/devtools` migrated off its bespoke `build.ts`; now uses\n  `fe build toolkit/devtools` — Solid auto-detection covers it since\n  `solid-js` remains in its dependencies\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01LoG9hwHpgp29cvXsJ1neum\n\n* docs: add source-first deployment model section to root AGENTS.md\n\nGives agents and developers a named mental model for the JIT-on-server\npattern so it does not need re-explaining at the start of each session.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01LoG9hwHpgp29cvXsJ1neum\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","