mesonNS","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gerenciamento-de-Estoque/sistema-estoque-front/commits/b45169db22725c6b39cc8edcb15babafb0a5807c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-23T23:37:37Z","email":"emesonneves111@gmail.com","name":"Emeson Santos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-23T23:37:37Z","email":"emesonneves111@gmail.com","name":"Emeson Santos"},"message":"fix(vendas): correção de layout e scroll no carrinho do PDV\n\n- Corrige bug onde o botão \"Finalizar Venda\" desaparecia ao adicionar muitos itens (5+).\n- Ajusta a estrutura do carrinho para usar Flexbox (`flex-1`, `min-h-0`), garantindo que apenas a lista de itens tenha rolagem.\n- Fixa o rodapé (totais e botão) na base do card, independente da quantidade de produtos.\n- Garante que o container ocupe a altura correta em telas Desktop.","tree":{"sha":"06c8ab62dbc7a9b5e4d23a2315e0ac8dbb4a26c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gerenciamento-de-Estoque/sistema-estoque-front/git/trees/06c8ab62dbc7a9b5e4d23a2315e0ac8dbb4a26c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gerenciamento-de-Estoque/sistema-estoque-front/git/commits/b45169db22725c6b39cc8edcb15babafb0a5807c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178935164?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmesonNS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmesonNS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmesonNS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmesonNS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EmesonNS","id":178935164,"login":"EmesonNS","node_id":"U_kgDOCqpVfA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmesonNS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmesonNS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmesonNS/repos","site_admin