leArrayEntriesToHTML, compileGroupedWorkEntriesToLaTeX,\n  compileGroupedWorkEntriesToHTML to take templatePath: string\n- Remove validateTemplatePath calls, as paths are now resolved externally\n\n* feat: Integrate theme loader into sync-latex.ts\n\n- Add template mode check and ThemeLoaderImpl instantiation\n- Update all LaTeX and HTML compilers to use getTemplatePath for dynamic template resolution\n- Support legacy and theme modes with RESUME_TEMPLATE_MODE feature flag\n- Maintain backward compatibility with existing behavior\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Sushruth Sastry <sushruth.sastry@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"3473afa7167b72ea90314224842a0fc223b59e9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sushruth/resume/git/trees/3473afa7167b72ea90314224842a0fc223b59e9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sushruth/resume/git/commits/07a9f0cde0a89411f4513089b9da5a52c9165c55","verification":{"payload":"tree 3473afa7167b72ea90314224842a0fc223b59e9c\nparent 039c62d501853f45719d0eb7c72c3ddd787531ee\nauthor Sushruth Sastry <2114206+sushruth@users.noreply.github.com> 1769503519 -0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1769503519 -0800\n\nfeat: Implement Phase 3 - Theme Loader (#6)\n\n* feat: Add environment variable support and theme loader foundation\n\n- Add env.ts for RESUME_TEMPLATE_MODE flag support\n- Add theme.types.ts with ThemeLoader interface\n- Add theme-loader.ts with ThemeLoaderImpl and fallback logic\n\n* feat: Move templates to infrastructure/templates/default/ for theme system\n\n- Copy LaTeX and HTML templates from cli/src/templates/ to infrastructure/templates/default/\n- Prepare for user overrides in user-content/templates/\n\n* refactor: Update converters to accept template paths instead of enums\n\n- Change compileTemplate, compileTemplateHTML, compileArrayEntriesToLaTeX,\n  compileArrayEntriesToHTML, compileGroupedWorkEntriesToLaTeX,\n  compileGroupedWorkEntriesToHTML to take templatePath: string\n- Remove validateTemplatePath calls, as paths are now re