rl":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bhagatprasad/ElectAI/commit/4995d826839cf4b3928808670157ca8d8edd9695","node_id":"C_kwDOQzO3vdoAKDQ5OTVkODI2ODM5Y2Y0YjM5Mjg4MDg2NzAxNTdjYThkOGVkZDk2OTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bhagatprasad/ElectAI/commit/51e8bcef1b089e6cf7863065b0199aab30380673","sha":"51e8bcef1b089e6cf7863065b0199aab30380673","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhagatprasad/ElectAI/commits/51e8bcef1b089e6cf7863065b0199aab30380673"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/bhagatprasad/ElectAI/commit/1119c53e645fb8a3a6c743e1f55f879171277b3a","sha":"1119c53e645fb8a3a6c743e1f55f879171277b3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhagatprasad/ElectAI/commits/1119c53e645fb8a3a6c743e1f55f879171277b3a"}],"sha":"4995d826839cf4b3928808670157ca8d8edd9695","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhagatprasad/ElectAI/commits/4995d826839cf4b3928808670157ca8d8edd9695"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6724994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhagatprasad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhagatprasad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhagatprasad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhagatprasad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bhagatprasad","id":6724994,"login":"bhagatprasad","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjQ5OTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhagatprasad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhagatprasad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhagatprasad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhagatprasad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhagatprasad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhagatprasad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhagatprasad/ElectAI/commits/1119c53e645fb8a3a6c743e1f55f879171277b3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-10T12:10:19Z","email":"bhagatprasad8@yahoo.com","name":"bhagatprasad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-10T12:10:19Z","email":"bhagatprasad8@yahoo.com","name":"bhagatprasad"},"message":"The error is because `isMobile()` returns different values during change detection. This happens when you access `window` inside a getter function. Let me fix this:\n\n## **app.component.ts** (Fixed - No dynamic isMobile() in template)\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component, Inject, PLATFORM_ID, AfterViewInit, HostListener } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { CommonModule, isPlatformBrowser } from ''@angular/common'';\nimport { RouterOutlet } from ''@angular/router'';\nimport { HeaderComponent } from ''./layout/header.component'';\nimport { SidebarComponent } from ''./layout/sidebar.component'';\n\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-root'',\n  standalone: true,\n  imports: [CommonModule, RouterOutlet, HeaderComponent, SidebarComponent],\n  templateUrl: ''./app.component.html'',\n  styleUrls: [''./app.component.css'']\n})\nexport class AppComponent implements AfterViewInit {\n  title = ''ElectAI'';\n  sidebarOpen = false;\n  sidebarCollapsed = false;\n  isMobileView = false; // Store as property, not computed\n  private isBrowser: boolean;\n\n  constructor(@Inject(PLATFORM_ID) private platformId: Object) {\n    this.isBrowser = isPlatformBrowser(this.platformId);\n  }\n\n  ngAfterViewInit() {\n    if (this.isBrowser && typeof window !== ''undefined'') {\n      this.updateScreenState();\n    }\n  }\n\n  private updateScreenState() {\n    if (!this.isBrowser || typeof window === ''undefined'') return;\n\n    const width = window.innerWidth;\n    this.isMobileView = width <= 768;\n    this.sidebarCollapsed = width <= 1024;\n  }\n\n  toggleSidebar() {\n    if (this.isMobileView) {\n      this.sidebarOpen = !this.sidebarOpen;\n    } else {\n      this.sidebarCollapsed = !this.sidebarCollapsed;\n    }\n  }\n\n  closeSidebar() {\n    if (this.isMobileView) {\n      this.sidebarOpen = false;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @HostListener(''window:resize'')\n  onResize() {\n    if (!this.isBrowser) return;\n\n    this.updateScreenState();\n\n    // Close mobile sidebar when resizing to desktop\n    if (!this.isMobileView && this.sidebarOpen) {\n      this.sidebarOpen = false;\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## **app.component.html** (Use stored property, not function)\n\n```html\n<div class=\"layout\">\n  <!-- Sidebar Component -->\n  <app-sidebar\n    [open]=\"sidebarOpen\"\n    [collapsed]=\"sidebarCollapsed\"\n    (closeSidebar)=\"closeSidebar()\"\n  ></app-sidebar>\n\n  <!-- Main Content Area -->\n  <div class=\"main\" [class.shifted]=\"sidebarCollapsed && !isMobileView\">\n    <!-- Header Component -->\n    <app-header (menuClick)=\"toggleSidebar()\"></app-header>\n\n    <!-- Main Content with SINGLE router-outlet -->\n    <main class=\"content\">\n      <router-outlet></router-outlet>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Mobile Overlay -->\n  <div\n    class=\"overlay\"\n    *ngIf=\"sidebarOpen && isMobileView\"\n    (click)=\"closeSidebar()\"\n  ></div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## **Alternative: Even simpler - Remove isMobile check from template**\n\nIf you still get errors, remove `isMobile()` from the template completely:\n\n### **app.component.ts** (Simpler)\n```typescript\nimport { Component } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { CommonModule } from ''@angular/common'';\nimport { RouterOutlet } from ''@angular/router'';\nimport { HeaderComponent } from ''./layout/header.component'';\nimport { SidebarComponent } from ''./layout/sidebar.component'';\n\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-root'',\n  standalone: true,\n  imports: [CommonModule, RouterOutlet, HeaderComponent, SidebarComponent],\n  templateUrl: ''./app.component.html'',\n  styleUrls: [''./app.component.css'']\n})\nexport class AppComponent {\n  title = ''ElectAI'';\n  sidebarOpen = false;\n  sidebarCollapsed = false;\n\n  toggleSidebar() {\n    // Simple toggle for now\n    this.sidebarCollapsed = !this.sidebarCollapsed;\n  }\n\n  closeSidebar() {\n    this.sidebarOpen = false;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### **app.component.html** (Simpler)\n```html\n<div class=\"layout\">\n  <!-- Sidebar Component -->\n  <app-sidebar\n    [open]=\"sidebarOpen\"\n    [collapsed]=\"sidebarCollapsed\"\n    (closeSidebar)=\"closeSidebar()\"\n  ></app-sidebar>\n\n  <!-- Main Content Area -->\n  <div class=\"main\" [class.shifted]=\"sidebarCollapsed\">\n    <!-- Header Component -->\n    <app-header (menuClick)=\"toggleSidebar()\"></app-header>\n\n    <!-- Main Content with SINGLE router-outlet -->\n    <main class=\"content\">\n      <router-outlet></router-outlet>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Mobile Overlay -->\n  <div\n    class=\"overlay\"\n    *ngIf=\"sidebarOpen\"\n    (click)=\"closeSidebar()\"\n  ></div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### **app.component.css** (Update CSS for simpler logic)\n```css\n.layout {\n  display: flex;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fafc, #eef2ff);\n  font-family: ''Inter'', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, ''Segoe UI'', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  position: relative;\n  overflow-x: hidden;\n}\n\n.main {\n  flex: 1;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n  width: 100%;\n  margin-left: 0;\n}\n\n/* Desktop: Show sidebar with different widths */\n.main.shifted {\n  margin-left: 70px;\n  width: calc(100% - 70px);\n}\n\n/* Default desktop state (not shifted) */\n@media (min-width: 769px) {\n  .main:not(.shifted) {\n    margin-left: 260px;\n    width: calc(100% - 260px);\n  }\n}\n\n/* Mobile: Full width, sidebar slides in */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .main {\n    margin-left: 0 !important;\n    width: 100% !important;\n  }\n}\n\n.content {\n  flex: 1;\n  padding: 24px;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  min-height: calc(100vh - 64px);\n}\n\n.overlay {\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(3px);\n  z-index: 1500;\n  animation: fadeIn 0.2s ease;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n/* Hide overlay on desktop */\n@media (min-width: 769px) {\n  .overlay {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes fadeIn {\n  from { opacity: 0; }\n  to { opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .content {\n    padding: 20px;\n  }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\n  .content {\n    padding: 16px;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## **Run:**\n```bash\n# Clear cache\nng cache clean\n\n# Run with simple version\nng serve --open --poll 1000\n```\n\n## **The problem was:**\n1. `isMobile()` function was called during change detection\n2. It returned different values between checks (race condition)\n3. Angular detected this as an error (ExpressionChangedAfterItHasBeenCheckedError)\n\n## **Solution:**\n1. **Store the value** in a property (`isMobileView`) instead of computing it\n2. **Update it only** in lifecycle hooks and event handlers\n3. **Or remove it completely** from the template if not needed\n\n**Use the simpler version first** to get it working, then add responsive features back gradually.","tree":{"sha":"53fb2ad51768880c42c24625a8526328633e8471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhagatprasad/ElectAI/git/trees/53fb2ad51768880c42c24625a8526328633e8471"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhagatprasad/ElectAI/git/commits/1119c53e645fb8a3a6c743e1f55f879171277b3a","verification":{"payload":