leshub/commits/9cdba0a74f97ff2b43e284f48ec0418919110eee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-13T16:19:34Z","email":"ps.sanoop@yahoo.com","name":"Snoops"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-13T16:19:34Z","email":"ps.sanoop@yahoo.com","name":"Snoops"},"message":"Implement LOW priority audit fixes\n\nL-01: Reduce Startup Logging in Production\n- Already implemented (NODE_ENV check in server.js)\n\nL-02: Add npm audit to CI\n- Created GitHub Actions workflow (.github/workflows/ci.yml)\n- Runs tests on Node 18.x and 20.x\n- Includes npm audit for security scanning\n\nL-03: Cache Fonts Locally\n- Downloaded Montserrat font files (Regular, SemiBold, Bold, ExtraBold)\n- Updated puppeteerPdfService to use local fonts as base64 data URIs\n- Falls back to Google Fonts if local files unavailable\n\nL-04: Add Pre-commit Hook for Secrets\n- Created pre-commit hook to scan for credentials, API keys, passwords\n- Added scripts/setup-hooks.js for easy installation\n- Added npm run setup:hooks command\n\nL-05: TypeScript Migration Planning\n- Created docs/TYPESCRIPT_MIGRATION_PLAN.md with migration strategy\n- Outlines phased approach: Setup -> Backend -> Frontend -> Tests\n- Estimated 4-6 days for full migration\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc2bb2a56b8a5d43f4eff75517e02af2a1ec8d5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snoopiam/saleshub/git/trees/bc2bb2a56b8a5d43f4eff75517e02af2a1ec8d5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snoopiam/saleshub/git/commits/9cdba0a74f97ff2b43e284f48ec0418919110eee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186879703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Snoopiam","id":186879703,"login":"Snoopiam","node_id":"U_kgDOCyOO1w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Snoopiam/saleshub/commit/9cdba0a74f97ff2b43e284f48ec0418919110eee","node_id":"C_kwDOQzkRutoAKDljZGJhMGE3NGY5N2ZmMmI0M2UyODRmNDhlYzA0MTg5MTkxMTBlZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Snoopiam/saleshub/commit/d6ab44a21799b0280807b861a78d02067c104b0d","sha":"d6ab44a21799b0280807b861a78d02067c104b0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snoopiam/saleshub/commits/d6ab44a21799b0280807b861a78d02067c104b0d"}],"sha":"9cdba0a74f97ff2b43e284f48ec0418919110eee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snoopiam/saleshub/commits/9cdba0a74f97ff2b43e284f48ec0418919110eee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186879703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Snoopiam","id":186879703,"login":"Snoopiam","node_id":"U_kgDOCyOO1w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snoopiam/saleshub/commits/d6ab44a21799b0280807b861a78d02067c104b0d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-13T16:02:19Z","email":"ps.sanoop@yahoo.com","name":"Snoops"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-13T16:02:19Z","email":"ps.sanoop@yahoo.com","name":"Snoops"},"message":"Implement security audit remediation (CRITICAL, HIGH, MEDIUM)\n\nCRITICAL fixes (12):\n- C-01: Fix MongoDB connection leak with singleton manager\n- C-02: Add XSS sanitization to PDF service (escapeHtml)\n- C-03: Implement rate limiting (20 PDF/100 API per 15min)\n- C-04: Restrict static file serving to specific directories\n- C-05: Add security headers via Helmet middleware\n- C-06: Fix Puppeteer browser race condition\n- C-07: Reduce payload size limit to 10MB\n- C-08: Configure CORS with allowlist\n- C-09: Encrypt localStorage financial data (AES-GCM 256-bit)\n- C-10: Validate ObjectId parameters\n- C-11: Sanitize error messages for production\n- C-12: Add request timeout middleware (2 min)\n\nHIGH fixes (14):\n- H-01 to H-14: Graceful shutdown, DB timeouts, error handling,\n  page close recovery, image error feedback, IndexedDB transactions,\n  URL memory leak fix, payment plan limits, font timeout increase,\n  payload validation, enhanced health check, request ID tracking,\n  Puppeteer optimization, legacy PDF cleanup, compression middleware,\n  unified filename sanitization\n\nMEDIUM fixes (9):\n- M-01: Add retry logic with exponential backoff to PDF export\n- M-02: Add offline detection with banner notification\n- M-03: Improve villa form labels with proper accessibility\n- M-04: Add loading overlay for async operations\n- M-05: Validate environment variables at startup\n- M-06: Add metrics collection service (/metrics endpoint)\n- M-08: Improve color contrast for WCAG compliance\n- M-10: Implement request queue (max 2 concurrent PDFs)\n- M-11: Add progress indicators during PDF generation\n\nNew files:\n- backend/src/db/connection.js (MongoDB connection manager)\n- backend/src/services/metricsService.js (metrics tracking)\n- backend/src/services/requestQueue.js (PDF queue management)\n- js/utils/crypto.js (Web Crypto API encryption)\n\nNew endpoints:\n- GET /metrics (server metrics)\n- GET /api/pdf/queue-status (PDF queue status)\n\nDependencies added: helmet, express-rate-limit, compression\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7102c3ab146fb83e04e339c505f64250d294d7b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snoopiam/saleshub/git/trees/7102c3ab146fb83e04e339c505f64250d294d7b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snoopiam/saleshub/git/commits/d6ab44a21799b0280807b861a78d02067c104b0d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186879703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Snoopiam","id":186879703,"login":"Snoopiam","node_id":"U_kgDOCyOO1w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Snoopiam/saleshub/commit/d6ab44a21799b0280807b861a78d02067c104b0d",