ile path) and createdBy text (hardcoded\nin HTML).\n\n- Added urlToBase64() to convert static file paths to base64\n- Added getLogoFromDOM() to read #logoImg src and convert if needed\n- Updated getCurrentBranding() to read .created-by-footer from DOM\n- Logo sources checked in order: IndexedDB → memory → localStorage → DOM\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f515ae9e234a479936445b4904a1b3e010e0e049","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snoopiam/saleshub/git/trees/f515ae9e234a479936445b4904a1b3e010e0e049"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snoopiam/saleshub/git/commits/8b92401b34e58af06597e7da3d6da3d3f47681d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186879703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Snoopiam","id":186879703,"login":"Snoopiam","node_id":"U_kgDOCyOO1w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snoopiam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Snoopiam/saleshub/commit/8b92401b34e58af06597e7da3d6da3d3f47681d0","node_id":"C_kwDOQzkRutoAKDhiOTI0MDFiMzRlNThhZjA2NTk3ZTdkYTNkNmRhM2QzZjQ3NjgxZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Snoopiam/saleshub/commit/9e411c93629f16a9d225aa2799568be84ae152dc","sha":